  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 8.0.0-Beta-2 - 2026-02-19\n\n- Renamed the following Services & their interfaces IS3Service -> IAwsS3Service, ISnsService -> IAwsSnsService, ISqsService -> IAwsSqsService, SnsService --> AwsSnsService, SqsService --> AwsSqsService, S3Service --> AwsS3Service\n- Added Aws messaging feature. Using AWS.Messaging we can publish SNS ans SQS event using BaseEvent class.\n- Changed the method name and made async methods: GetPreSignedUrl => GetPreSignedUrlAsync, GetPreSignedObject => GetPreSignedObjectAsync",
